gned}],\\,W=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -5 & -10 \\\\ 5 & 6 & 10 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -3\\end{aligned}]?\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that the $2$nd and the $3$rd rows are the same in both matrices. The only row that has changed is the $1$st row. \n\nBy considering the given row operations that modify the $1$st row, we notice that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 6 & 10 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -3\\end{aligned}]\\,{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+5\\cdot {R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}5 & -5 & -10 \\\\ 5 & 6 & 10 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =W.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required row operation is\n\n$$\n{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+5{R}_{3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130103/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "691b9107-a935-5965-b3ac-0f3a193ce9bd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130103"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-20241/selection/04429f4ea15eb4af81d44cead2195a435aa8607effac07fc8f0664fde9195a2c" :answer/id #uuid "81379e1a-367c-534d-9bab-f0827b40ea85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{2}↔{R}_{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20241/selection/f3d13bd25f65d465eaa2aa49e03f5f99407b842288a97be2af7238a3d9703ba2" :answer/id #uuid "cd1c012a-c06d-5186-855b-bb73f65a1b59" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20241/selection/f8291cb8855f3f343f6897c8e6df825f622606a6aaeb2e1e1b3ddea7849b5f81" :answer/id #uuid "5912f3df-7eb3-5346-99ef-1feeecf21c60" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{2}↔{R}_{1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20241/selection/9fb8f1111e0e17104e113fefb105b96acdc219345a2537a9d626d73fa56cf5a4" :answer/id #uuid "86dd6021-aa47-544f-832d-06cd8d3e339c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20241/selection/ece51bbe10216b0