tions ["q-20241"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-20388"] :question/problem "Given that\n$C=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]$,\nwhich of the following elementary row operations makes ${a}_{22}=0?$" :question/worked-solution "Of the given options, we consider the row operation \n\n$$\n{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{3}.\n$$\n\nApplying the above row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2)\\cdot {R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required row operation is\n\n$$\n{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-130304/selection/fa649d5254fd2795a70ae15bcfa64b6e6bd01e2b4e2967fd5a416fd6c921ff14" :answer/id #uuid "3fbb733f-ec6c-5a13-ae21-7ebb71a7830c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-3){R}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130304/selection/7464d375c262472e34d6ff04aacc0efb30a3f3f9c727673965683a6629bfb102" :answer/id #uuid "5496d40d-d9e5-533d-b879-144b8b0d5bb3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130304/selection/d08f3558658610d29715769fc4e3be1ae852695298e29e031b43d08f1c45d01d" :answer/id #uuid "77cc71b8-4f5f-5a70-bbab-cb9252cf341b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{1}↔{R}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130304/selection/da987fdde44243550a6b097e2597a1e45f2eb05b0dffe7cb31f755964048446b" :answer/id #uuid "5d1ef382-5b59-58ca-b26d-8913eb0d3998" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{3}↔{R}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130304/selection/86f4a6743677615aceb805ff95810bbad573bc378b5f0dc256c30dbb94397b7d" :answer/id #uuid "d3ad2fc8-6cfe-589c-